  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## v1.11.1 (patch)\n\nChanges since v1.11.0:\n\n- Hold the gathering progress test's call open without Thread.Sleep ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Report found files one at a time while patterns gather in parallel [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Expect the batch pattern, not the file name, for a ? wildcard ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Let Edit Batch clear the description with a \"-\" answer [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Move the pattern attribution tests next to the helpers ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Attribute batch results to the pattern that found each file [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Search a pattern listed twice in a batch only once [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
